  <diagram name="CL-2 자체가 안 들어옴" id="page_CL-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="START_CL-2" value="시작" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7e632;strokeColor=#d7e632;fontColor=#1f1f23;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="-30" width="100" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_start_CL-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#f2ead9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="START_CL-2" target="n1_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1_CL-2" value="[n1] 지속광 전원 케이블 재접촉 해볼 수 있을까요? 지속광에 접촉된 연결부와 키오스크 측면 멀티탭에 연결되어 있는 전원 케이블 두 곳 모두 확인 부탁드립니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2a_CL-2" value="[n2a] 지속광 자체 문제 혹은 지속광 전원 케이블의 자체 문제일 수 있습니다. 우선 지속광 전원 케이블 먼저 교체 테스트 해볼 수 있을까요? 여분의 지속광 전원 케이블이 없다면 다른 부스의 전원 케이블을 가져와 교체 테스트 해주시면 됩니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3a_CL-2" value="[n3a] 지속광 자체의 문제로 확인됩니다. 여분의 지속광으로 교체 테스트 부탁드립니다. 여분이 없다면 다른 부스의 지속광 하나만 떼와서 교체 테스트 부탁드립니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2b_CL-2" value="[n2b] 해당 사진과 같이 기판에 접지되어 있는 형태라면:
1) 키오스크 PC 전원을 끈다
2) 키오스크 차단기를 내린다
3) 드라이버를 이용하여 피스를 풀어 해당 +와- 에 접지되어 있는 케이블을 뺐다가 다시 조여준다
4) 역순으로 키오스크 전원 ON 하여 상태 확인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="260" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3b_CL-2" value="[n3b] SMPS 기판의 문제일 확률이 큽니다. 하지만 지속광 자체의 문제일 가능성도 배제할 순 없어, 먼저 여분의 지속광으로 교체 테스트 부탁드립니다. 만약 여분의 지속광이 없다면 다른 부스의 지속광 하나만 떼와서 교체 테스트 부탁드립니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="480" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_0_CL-2" value="동일합니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CL-2" target="n2a_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_1_CL-2" value="멀티탭에 꽂히는게 아니라 어떤 기판에 접지되어 있어요" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CL-2" target="n2b_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="END_solved_CL-2" value="해결" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1c3a24;strokeColor=#4caf50;fontColor=#8ee29a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="40" width="160" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_2_CL-2" value="해결되었습니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CL-2" target="END_solved_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n2a_0_CL-2" value="동일합니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n2a_CL-2" target="n3a_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n2a_1_CL-2" value="해결되었습니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n2a_CL-2" target="END_solved_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="END_escalate_CL-2" value="담당자 연결" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#3a2a14;strokeColor=#e0a256;fontColor=#f0c98a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="180" width="160" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n3a_0_CL-2" value="동일합니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3a_CL-2" target="END_escalate_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n3a_1_CL-2" value="해결되었습니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3a_CL-2" target="END_solved_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n2b_0_CL-2" value="동일합니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n2b_CL-2" target="n3b_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n2b_1_CL-2" value="해결되었습니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n2b_CL-2" target="END_solved_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n3b_0_CL-2" value="동일합니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3b_CL-2" target="END_escalate_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n3b_1_CL-2" value="해결되었습니다" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3b_CL-2" target="END_solved_CL-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="CAM-1 카메라 자체 에러코드 발생" id="page_CAM-1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="START_CAM-1" value="시작" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7e632;strokeColor=#d7e632;fontColor=#1f1f23;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="-30" width="100" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_start_CAM-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#f2ead9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="START_CAM-1" target="n1_CAM-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1_CAM-1" value="[n1] 에러코드 몇 번일까요?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n01_CAM-1" value="[n01] 카메라 렌즈 간의 결합 불완전으로 렌즈 재결합이 필요합니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n70_CAM-1" value="[n70] 카메라 온도 문제입니다. 카메라 전원을 끈 상태로 5~10분 정도 대기 후, 다시 전원을 켜서 테스트해주세요." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="260" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_0_CAM-1" value="에러코드 01" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CAM-1" target="n01_CAM-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="END_as_CAM-1" value="A/S 필요" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#3a1418;strokeColor=#e07a7a;fontColor=#f2a3a3;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="40" width="160" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_1_CAM-1" value="에러코드 20" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CAM-1" target="END_as_CAM-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_n1_2_CAM-1" value="에러코드 30" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#d7e632;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n1_CAM-1" target="END_as_CAM-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
