  <diagram name="PRT-3 전원 차단 문구 발생" id="page_PRT-3">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="START_PRT-3" value="시작" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7e632;strokeColor=#d7e632;fontColor=#1f1f23;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="-30" width="100" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_start_PRT-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#8a8d97;fontColor=#f2ead9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="START_PRT-3" target="n1_PRT-3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1_PRT-3" value="[n1] 키오스크 앞문을 열어 프린터 전면부 LED가 들어와있는지 확인 필요합니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2a_PRT-3" value="[n2a] 프린터 AB 케이블 재접촉 후 테스트 부탁드립니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3a_PRT-3" value="[n3a] AB 케이블이 꽂혀있는 PC의 USB 포트 위치 변경 후 테스트 부탁드립니다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2c2f38;strokeColor=#5a5d68;fontColor=#f2ead9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
